DESCRIPTION:Spirituality · A yearly tradition\nhttps://sf.funcheap.com/ci
 ty-guide/november-street-fairs-festivals/\n\nNovember 26\, 2026 – SF (A
 lcatraz) – FREE (but adult boat tix to Alcatraz are $12) – The Indige
 nous Peoples Sunrise Ceremony is an annual event held every year on Thank
 sgiving on Alcatraz Island\, part of the San Francisco Ohlone Territory\,
  to commemorate the 1969-71 occupation of Alcatraz by the Indians of All 
 Tribes. Typically\, there are presenters on current and past Indigenous P
 eoples’ struggles
